{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_title", "source_sha256": "64a8d829cd1c7847f16b32a9c59ec2392ed467993909e1e3a20161b4d70f028d", "ja": "アイ・無限大∞ポテンシャル", "zh": "爱・无限大∞潜力", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cba22b1044633ab8a4c8a2641215b58b5bdbed06585f5e71e704db2f1fe80042", "ja": "学園祭の実行委員長と新曲お披露目公演が\n重なった茜。周囲の心配をよそに準備にレッ\nスンにと張り切る。そんな中、副委員長に\n「どうしてそんなに頑張れるの？」と尋ね\nられた茜は、彼女をライブに招待する。", "zh": "学园祭的执行委员长与新曲公开演出撞\n到了一起。茜不顾周围人的担忧，干劲\n十足地投入到筹备与练习中。在此期间，\n副委员长问茜“为什么能这么拼命呢？”，\n茜便邀请她来看自己的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5bcd0de661395f6846865e16ea8d749719445220ae8893dc386e080d5b2060f5", "ja": "（満を持して迎えた、茜の新曲披露公演。\nお客さんの拍手と歓声が鳴り止まない……）", "zh": "（茜万事俱备后迎来的新曲发布演出。客人的掌声与欢呼久久没有停歇……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "8e431185db77a14d76d8e72a9178abd9ed59cf202176035f345c25a2d073042f", "ja": "みんなーっ！　今日は茜ちゃんを応援してくれて、\nホントにホントに、ありがとー！", "zh": "大家——！今天真的很感谢大家\n来为小茜加油——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1002_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "8683cb77fae45e81efa1190eb86b51ce028ac1a414c7b7b7216b5e1873242e16", "ja": "ワアアアァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "b9090c92cd27164cd004b2bd6067619777d9600be112cef511a0419127dc6313", "ja": "うんうん！　みんなの気持ちは、バッチリ届いたよ♪\n茜ちゃんのお返しも、ちゃんと届いたかニャ？", "zh": "嗯嗯！大家的心意，我已经完美收到了♪  \n小茜的回礼，大家也有好好收到喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "7a01aeb9f9c19e8081657dc80a6cd0a3e76821372bb82a3efa9a1caa59f8f1a1", "ja": "茜ちゃんは、これからもみんなのアイドルです！\nだからみんなも茜ちゃんのこと、いっぱい応援してね！", "zh": "小茜今后也会一直是大家的偶像！所以大家也要多多支持小茜哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1005_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "5baadef2b21f62a810be5a3937ac3cf71f1553dce8e90af74b46f0726a8abfb9", "ja": "ワアアアアアァァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1007_p", "source_sha256": "65c99e165cbf0d75f234d0b0902de16a676e90f968c2d465e945372483df155c", "ja": "よし、会場にいたお客さんは全員出たな。\nあとはみんなのところへ行って……ん？", "zh": "好，会场里的客人全都离开了。  \n接下来去大家那边……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1008_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "d79e498028fd629e806d23649f5f7ea3e1f3287a25cba7be49a23bebe76d45d5", "ja": "あ、あの、すみません！\n野々原茜さんって、今、会えたりしますか……？", "zh": "啊、那个，不好意思！\n现在能见到野野原茜先生吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1009_p", "source_sha256": "46d0af2269ecf5cff65a6d709a2de89f86b93ea5baa48d4e31f63072e1082cb5", "ja": "え？　ええと、あなたは……あ！\nもしかして、茜が招待したっていう学校の？", "zh": "咦？呃，您是……啊！难道就是茜邀请来的那位同学？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1010_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "c92f219c0057dbffeaaf158f267cc3bd211d31becf96e0dd5591eb8cbc3f1389", "ja": "は、はい！　今日は、野々原さんに招待して\nもらって……あの、ライブ、すごかったです！", "zh": "是、是的！　今天是野野原小姐邀请我来的……那个，演唱会真的好厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1011_p", "source_sha256": "399a73bddfa9cc690b2d017dd4364fffe73e9912d0cf1ff6fb2f32a8e04c222e", "ja": "ありがとう！　良かったら、感想は本人に……\nあ、いたいた。おーい、茜！", "zh": "谢谢！可以的话，把感想直接告诉本人吧……\n啊，在那儿在那儿。喂——茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "1c775a5233e41656a6ae3af6d8c8c2180d48e8a7d7f749c40bd0729a4756924d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}ちゃん！\n副委員長ちゃんも、ここにいたんだね！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n副委员长也在这里呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1013_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "ef7704decbc36a5a5b84e3dd7599d7b2114fa48b973b19a38dd9c9c1c3ee19f9", "ja": "野々原さん！　あの、招待してくれてありがとう。\nライブ、すっごく楽しかった……！", "zh": "茜小姐！那个，谢谢你邀请我。\n演唱会真的特别开心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "6d99f66ba07399e3db3b52028459599e6a535ed97938b551756f23bc313c565f", "ja": "そっか、よかった♪　学校の友達にもバッチリライブを\n楽しんでもらえるとは、やはり茜ちゃんは天才……！", "zh": "这样啊，那就好♪　连学校的朋友们也都能尽情享受这场演唱会，果然小茜是天才……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1015_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "570a8040e3efaa0ff4476e18432053c08d61e58b3a36fe9de0354b4b19c67247", "ja": "それで、あの……私、ちょっとだけわかった気が\nしたの。野々原さんが、どうして頑張れるのか……。", "zh": "然后，那个……我好像稍微明白了\n野野原小姐为什么能坚持努力……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1016_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "a2899ceb5ce9069445457876a4304d7e02f649af14843640b997df19ab02b77d", "ja": "野々原さんは、普段からファンの人達の気持ちを\n受け止めて、お返しをしてたんだね……。", "zh": "原来野野原小姐平时一直都在接住粉丝们的心意，再回馈给他们啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1017_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "b2293632b1bb4dabf41cc717c65ac7afc1f0826ac3149ac6d5c438451f70ff9b", "ja": "だから、そんなにも頑張れるんだね……！", "zh": "所以，你才能这么努力啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4fc286bfd9e1fda5dffa9b0a2590204c8eaf7047fd3df1317c0f09b394ef1bbe", "ja": "お返し……。", "zh": "回礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "07dc3beceb7385016d89ebf912e5e7983eee5df2932d016c7ce4a59a64ad614b", "ja": "おっ、さすが副委員長ちゃん！\nつまりはそういうコトなのだよ、うんうん！", "zh": "哦，不愧是副委员长！\n也就是说，就是这么回事，嗯嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "9b187faaae99b7dc1ff790eb0a58bc4d06fc3f7375ac198066424620557b4f83", "ja": "ファンのみんなは茜ちゃんを見てハッピーになり、\n茜ちゃんはみんなに応援されてハッピーになる！", "zh": "粉丝们看到小茜就会感到幸福，\n而小茜得到大家的支持也会感到幸福！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "e19f1d3a5f4d3a0cd822f97a4f7ccf989a1ac7be5769dc663429e832ee010678", "ja": "これはつまり、ハッピーの永久機関なのだよ！\nハッ！　茜ちゃんは、真理に気付いてしまった……！？", "zh": "也就是说，这是快乐的永动机哦！\n哈！小茜发现真理了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1022_fukuiincho", "source_sha256": "016dd3e3f116455f1a083d2d6ee5eda339b13bcd153ce930c89885e82f1e93c0", "ja": "あっ、もうこんな時間……あの、今日は本当に\nありがとう！　それじゃ、また明日学校でね！", "zh": "啊，都已经这个时间了……那个，今天真的谢谢你！那明天在学校见哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "73bd18f1c93688583d08211de230ad6a80de4c56ad8d5f7e79a28c81cb81feb1", "ja": "あっ、うん！　学園祭まであと1週間、\nがんばろうね！　バイバ～イ！", "zh": "啊，对了！距离学园祭还有1周，一起加油吧！拜拜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1024_se", "source_sha256": "5eb294583bc6f40ad4e1df90eb85c503fc9ab6b6afb330bcf1c8be5b6f361216", "ja": "タッタッタ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ea02b6f6d9532bef66775f60e92f6db8adc1ea19d5958e4839fa3de960c81cc1", "ja": "ハッピーの永久機関か……正に理想だな。\n茜、いつからそんな事を考えてたんだ？", "zh": "幸福的永动机吗……简直就是理想啊。\n茜，你从什么时候开始考虑这种事的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "22e79ad24f672466a298f7ee4a4b73ac8dc7dbb715e7360306efc24c80d00cd1", "ja": "フッフッフ……茜ちゃんを見くびってはいけないよ、\n{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……可不能小看小茜哦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "2e241f1c74e1afe4daf792d7837dbc2945a01c79acc22da243d33d6ab35b30bd", "ja": "なんて、茜ちゃんも、今副委員長ちゃんに言われて\n気がついたんだけどね！　ニャハ☆", "zh": "话虽如此，小茜也是刚才被副委员长提醒后才注意到的呢！喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_086_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_086_1028_p", "source_sha256": "32d219c8f15e46f86385a6eb09519248ae2a9f4e1353a32c740cc8de3a7f2e5d", "ja": "（友達に言われてとはいえ、いい気づきには違いない。\n茜の成長は、いよいよ本物かもしれないな……！）", "zh": "（虽说是朋友提醒了她，但这无疑是一次很好的觉察。茜的成长，说不定终于是真正的成长了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
